<!DOCTYPE score-partwise PUBLIC "-//Recordare//DTD MusicXML 4.0 Partwise//EN" "http://www.musicxml.org/dtds/partwise.dtd">
<!--
  Written for the score-import tests. Seven bars of piano exercising the form and
  timing rules: an explicit repeat (bars 1-2), a repeat with no forward sign after it
  (bars 3-4), a meter change 3/4 -> 6/8 and a tempo change 90 -> 120 at bar 5, an
  unbracketed last ending (bar 6 is ending 1, bar 7 has no bracket), D.C. al Fine with
  Fine at bar 5, a grace note and a tie.
  Played: 1 2 1 2 3 4 3 4 5 6 5 7, then D.C.: 1 2 3 4 5 (Fine).
-->
